1
00:00:00,084 --> 00:00:03,464
This is just gonna be two weeks
of moping and tedious emo songs...

2
00:00:03,629 --> 00:00:07,089
(Sheldon:)...and calling me to come down
to pet stores to look at cats.

3
00:00:08,926 --> 00:00:10,636
(Sheldon:)I don't know if I can take it.

4
00:00:11,554 --> 00:00:13,474
(Raj:)You could power down.

5
00:00:15,766 --> 00:00:19,516
(Howard:)Well, as usual,
Wolowitz has the solution.

6
00:00:20,229 --> 00:00:23,359
(Howard:)I happen to know a place
where there are plenty of eligible women...

7
00:00:23,524 --> 00:00:25,314
(Howard:)...and Leonard could have his pick.

8
00:00:25,484 --> 00:00:27,824
[LATIN MUSIC PLAYS OVER SPEAKERS]

9
00:00:35,244 --> 00:00:37,164
(Class instructor:)Remember the Latin hips.

10
00:00:37,496 --> 00:00:40,376
(Class instructor:)Shoulders stay still and we sway.

11
00:00:45,629 --> 00:00:47,919
(Class instructor:)One, two, three.

12
00:00:48,591 --> 00:00:50,671
(Class instructor:)Five, six, seven.

13
00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:54,300
(Howard(to Leonard):)I think Mrs. Tishman's
got her eye on you.

14
00:00:54,722 --> 00:01:02,022
(Howard(to Leonard):)I've been there. You're in for a treat.

